Z||000002||tgowens||11-04-2001||09:23 PM||||revin, I think you are talking about the two small outlets on botttom of the thermostat housing........ those connect (by short rubber hose) to the two lines that go under the plenum and into the throttle body (they connect to the left ftont side of the plenum with an 12 point 8mm bolt) .........<P>But, if you are talking about two little metal hoses that would rub on the exhaust..... I'm at a loss too......Maybe I am not sure what you are referring to as the "fill cap"...<P>------------------<BR><A HREF="http://www.whgraphics.com" TARGET=_blank>West Highland Graphics & Design</A><BR><A HREF="http://www.cfog-i.org" TARGET=_blank>Classic Fiero Owners Group International</A>||||reg||1
